her the other copy's action depends on the same function I'm intervening on. Since its observation differs from mine, strict A-FDT would treat its node as a separate, non-intervened one, but the decision is functionally symmetric, so the essay's heuristic about evaluating an equivalent function may still link them.\n\nI'm treating the other copy's inputs as differing only in irrelevant labels, so with high correlation the two outputs would match. Working through a rho model of expected utility, the payoffs suggest cooperating once rho is above roughly 0.43, and since the reasoning is the same across both copies, I'd put rho high and pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether the other copy's action depends on the same function I'm intervening on. Since its observation differs from mine, strict A-FDT would treat its node as a separate, non-intervened one, but the decision is functionally symmetric, so the essay's heuristic about evaluating an equivalent function may still link them.\n\nI'm treating the other copy's inputs as differing only in irrelevant labels, so with high correlation the two outputs would match. Working through a rho model of expected utility, the payoffs suggest cooperating once rho is above roughly 0.43, and since the reasoning is the same across both copies, I'd put rho high and pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9718,"completion_tokens":915,"total_tokens":10633,"cost":0.057172,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.057172,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038872,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0183},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":366,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}